;; What this case exercises; edit by hand.  `bb corpus-accept' leaves it alone.
(:book "bornstein1989"
 :source "bornstein1989.pdf"
 :page 1
 :exercises "Two-column paper (APA journal): full-width title block and abstract over two flush prose columns, an author-note block at the left column's foot.  Poppler serves the right column before the left, and the sentence at the left column's foot continues at the right column's head.  The lane pass must form a region although the document profile is two-column-dominant, classify flush prose lanes as flows, and reorder them to page order: left column, then right, author note last.  The mid-sentence budget is the title's own second line - the PDF's text layer glues 'ofResearch'."
 :budget (:mid-sentence 1))
